%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%
flowchart LR
    subgraph Input
        Req[Requirement]
        Code[Existing Code]
    end

    subgraph ExecutionPlane["Execution Plane"]
        Analyze[Analyze]
        Generate[Generate]
        Test[Test]
        Verify[Verify]
    end

    subgraph ControlPlane["Control Plane APIs"]
        ArtifactAPI[Artifact API]
        EvidenceAPI[Evidence API]
    end

    subgraph Output
        Diff[Code Diff]
        Tests[Test Suite]
        Evidence[Evidence Bundle]
    end

    subgraph Storage["Control Plane Storage"]
        PG[(PostgreSQL)]
        Qdrant[(Qdrant)]
        Temporal[(Temporal)]
    end

    Req --> Analyze
    Code --> Qdrant
    Qdrant --> |Semantic Search| Analyze

    Analyze --> |Plan| Generate
    Generate --> |Diff| Test
    Test --> |Results| Verify

    Verify --> Diff
    Verify --> Tests
    Verify --> Evidence

    %% All writes go through Control Plane APIs
    Diff --> ArtifactAPI
    Tests --> ArtifactAPI
    Evidence --> EvidenceAPI

    ArtifactAPI --> PG
    EvidenceAPI --> PG

    Generate --> |State| Temporal
    Test --> |State| Temporal
